  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While Eight Extremities pin Five Elements Grandmaster under Calamity Luck Altar, the whole of Longevity Heaven resounds with bell chimes. They ask why the move activated. It did not ring when Five Elements Grandmaster attacked, so Heaven Extremity says it is pointing to another danger, even though Ancestor Giant Sun set the move to activate when they met with trouble. South Desolation Immortal wakes at the sound. Three long notes and two short notes, neither fast nor slow, mean that love Gu has entered Northern Plains. Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s descendants can gain some information just by hearing the bells. The Eight Extremities knew of the move but not those specific details until South Desolation Immortal spoke.",
